Description: Adversary-in-the-Middle reverse proxy framework for red teams
 PhantomGate is a next-generation AiTM reverse proxy framework designed
 for authorized penetration testing and Red Team engagements. It combines
 advanced network-level MITM attacks with application-level session
 hijacking capabilities rivaling Bettercap and Evilginx2.
 .
 Core Features:
  * 27 YAML-based phishlets (M365, Google, GitHub, LinkedIn, etc.)
  * Metasploit-style terminal with animated banners and real-time status
  * Advanced ARP poisoning with multi-target bidirectional spoofing
  * DNS attack suite: rebinding, wildcard poisoning, tunneling, cache poisoning
  * DoH bypass to force browsers back to regular DNS
  * Rogue AP creation with NAT for wireless attacks
  * BLE attack framework (scan, sniff, inject, spoof)
  * HID keyboard/mouse injection for USB attacks
  * Packet filtering engine with rule-based injection
  * Character-by-character keystroke injection
  * Plugin ecosystem with Go plugin loader
  * REST API server with authentication
  * Session replay and cookie hijacking
  * BotGuard and fingerprint evasion
  * Dynamic CA certificate generation
  * Shell completions (bash/zsh/fish)
  * Systemd service support
 .
 WARNING: This tool is designed exclusively for authorized penetration
 testing and Red Team engagements. Unauthorized use is illegal.
